# Right tetrahedron with 10 mm legs, faces use NEGATIVE (relative) indices.
# -1 = last vertex read so far, -2 = the one before, etc.
# Expected: same as tetrahedron.obj - area 236.60 mm^2, volume 166.67 mm^3.
o Tetrahedron negative
v 0 0 0
v 10 0 0
v 0 10 0
v 0 0 10
f -4 -2 -3
f -4 -3 -1
f -4 -1 -2
f -3 -2 -1
